          Your team works<br />
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-200 via-white to-[#a3ff12] bg-clip-text text-transparent">better when IT just works.</span>
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-xl"
