          Remote IT support for small businesses and distributed teams. We manage Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, email, devices, security, and automation—so your people can stay productive without technology getting in the way.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
