        <div class="mt-11 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-[#a3ff12]">✓</span>Microsoft 365 &amp; Google Workspace</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-[#a3ff12]">✓</span>Email, devices &amp; access security</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-[#a3ff12]">✓</span>Remote help when your team needs it</span>
